Z||000002||afRaceR||01-06-2001||04:40 AM||||I have a road rage story.........and for the first time, its not about me.<BR>I was living in arlington, and driving to work in Lewisville-anyone who lives in the metroplex knows this is one of the worst drives. <BR>Well anyways, I was driving down 360, of course 10-15 miles faster than everyone else, in the left hand lane. This *******  in a nissan four-dour comes roaring up behind me right on my bumper, I'm in my fiero so this kind of upsets me - that rear bumper isn't too far from your back in a fiero.<BR>So I give him a friendly middle finger salute just to let him know to get off my ass while I get around these cars so I can scoot over and let him by.<BR>Well, he keeps slowing down and speeding up against my bumper and I get really pissed. So I tap my brakes-not enough to actually engage my breaks but enough to make the lights come on. He fiercly applies his brakes-**** , I guess I scared him or something, and has this bloodymurder look on his face. I'm thinking, "yeah, I spilled his morning coffee all over his genitals", which I guess I did, becuase he comes screaming up beside me and throws his coffee cup at my car and breaks my quarter window, and then the little pussy barrels off for the exit to DWF airport.<BR>I was pissed because the guy messed up my car, but I found deep gratitude knowing that his balls got burned just because of me!!!!<BR>I'm so happy||||reg||1
